{
  "name": "LockIn — Réponses e-mail entrantes",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LockIn × n8n — Réponses entrantes (B2B2C)\n\n**Variables n8n** :\n- `CRON_SECRET` — identique à Vercel\n- `LOCKIN_API_URL` — ex. `https://lockin-web.online`\n- `LOCKIN_FROM_EMAIL` — expéditeur SMTP\n\n**Flux :** IMAP → parse `[LK-deliveryId]` → POST `/api/incoming-reply` → e-mail notif au créancier (si `notification` renvoyé).\n\n**Important :** l'API ajoute déjà `[LK-…]` dans le sujet des relances. Ne pas le dupliquer dans le workflow d'envoi.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
      "name": "Note de configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [180, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1d035963-fdf9-4b15-8c55-3d9871ab39ee",
      "name": "1. Email Trigger (IMAP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [240, 480],
      "credentials": {
        "imap": {
          "id": "REPLACE_IMAP_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "IMAP account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "for (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const email = item.json;\n  const subject = email.subject || '';\n  const textBody = email.text || email.html || '';\n  const regex = /\\[LK-([a-zA-Z0-9_-]+)\\]/;\n  const match = subject.match(regex) || textBody.match(regex);\n\n  item.json = {\n    deliveryId: match?.[1] || null,\n    senderEmail: email.from?.value?.[0]?.address || email.from || '',\n    subject,\n    body: textBody,\n    receivedAt: email.date || new Date().toISOString(),\n  };\n}\n\nreturn $input.all();"
      },
      "id": "c6fe0a73-0667-4acc-83a8-2bb5bd994f6f",
      "name": "2. Extraire deliveryId",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [480, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-delivery-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.deliveryId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-has-delivery-id",
      "name": "3. deliveryId trouvé ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [720, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.LOCKIN_API_URL.replace(/\\/$/, '') + '/api/incoming-reply' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.CRON_SECRET }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"deliveryId\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.deliveryId) }},\n  \"senderEmail\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.senderEmail) }},\n  \"subject\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.subject) }},\n  \"body\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c5b3a4ed-eea2-4c19-ab70-208651b5c658",
      "name": "4. POST /api/incoming-reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [960, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-notification",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.notification?.to || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-has-notification",
      "name": "5. Notif à envoyer ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1200, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.LOCKIN_FROM_EMAIL }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.notification.to }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.notification.subject }}",
        "html": "={{ $json.notification.html }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "send-creditor-notif",
      "name": "6. Notifier le créancier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1440, 320],
      "webhookId": "lockin-incoming-reply-notify",
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "REPLACE_SMTP_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "SMTP account"
        }
      },
      "continueOnFail": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "1. Email Trigger (IMAP)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "2. Extraire deliveryId",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "2. Extraire deliveryId": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "3. deliveryId trouvé ?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "3. deliveryId trouvé ?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "4. POST /api/incoming-reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "4. POST /api/incoming-reply": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "5. Notif à envoyer ?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "5. Notif à envoyer ?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "6. Notifier le créancier",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
